flowchart TB
  accTitle: Current Ducketz Loops system architecture
  accDescr: Eight independent recurring owners, their DATASTORE artifacts and direct dependencies, plus the separate hourly operations and overnight accuracy lane.

  SYSTEM["CURRENT PRODUCTION SHAPE<br/>Eight independently scheduled singleton owners exchange verified files and atomic pointers through C:/DATASTORE.<br/>Quarter-hour phase offsets improve freshness; they do not create one central transaction."]:::system

  subgraph RUNTIMES["RUNTIME OWNERSHIP AND DIRECT CONNECTIONS"]
    direction TB

    subgraph FOUNDATIONS["FOUNDATIONAL EVIDENCE OWNERS"]
      direction LR
      CME["1 · CME/L2 RUNTIME<br/>MBP-10 every 5 s · BBO every 15 s · OHLCV every 60 s<br/>Owns current CME events, L2 authority, and 1 h cross-asset context"]:::owner
      A["2 · LOOP A<br/>15-minute boundary · 20 s recurring pre-start pause<br/>Owns exact bar readiness, provider data, calculated features, and cycle state"]:::owner
      F["3 · DAILY ALFRED<br/>07:00 UTC · at most once per UTC date<br/>Owns causal macro vintages, release context, readiness, and daily receipt"]:::owner
    end

    subgraph QUARTER["INDEPENDENT QUARTER-HOUR OWNERS"]
      direction LR
      P["4 · ACTIVE PRICING<br/>every 15 min · phase +1<br/>Owns target outcomes and full option-pricing generations"]:::prediction
      B["5 · DIRECTIONAL LOOP B<br/>every 15 min · phase +5<br/>Owns calibrated 1 h / 4 h / 1 d / 1 w + weekly-component directional publications"]:::prediction
      O["6 · OPTIONS CAPTURE<br/>every 15 min · phase +6<br/>Owns prospective OPRA-first snapshots and pending fallback reconciliation"]:::owner
    end

    subgraph STRATEGY_TIER["STRATEGY AUTHORITIES"]
      direction LR
      S["7 · STRATEGY RUNTIME<br/>every 15 min · phase +10<br/>Owns exact-leg candidates, audits, scores, ranks, and current Strategy authority"]:::prediction
      T["8 · STRATEGY-PROFIT TRAINING<br/>daily at 22:00 UTC<br/>Owns promoted 1 d / 1 w profit models; weekly day components reuse the 1 d model"]:::trainer
    end

    W["OWNED PRICING WORKER<br/>one local materialize/train pass after fast target publication<br/>nonblocking · not independently scheduled"]:::worker
    H["HISTORY / BOOTSTRAP BOUNDARY<br/>verified OPRA ohlcv-1h + cbbo-1m partitions<br/>one-shot maintenance · not a recurring owner"]:::boundary

    CME -->|"R1 · hourly CME context"| B

    A -->|"R2 · exact bars + readiness"| P
    A -->|"R3 · readiness, target close, vol + cutoff"| O
    A -->|"R4 · bars, features + complete cycle"| B
    A -->|"R5 · stock BBO / liquidity"| S
    A ==>|"1 h stock bars"| T

    F -->|"R6 · causal FEDFUNDS"| P
    F -->|"R7 · macro context + readiness"| B
    B ==>|"R8 · asynchronous decision grid"| F

    P -.->|"R9 · optional target barrier proof"| O
    O -->|"R10 · earlier chains + later outcomes"| P
    P ==>|"R11 · optional opx__ surface"| B
    O -->|"R12 · opt__ quality surface"| B

    B -->|"R13 · exact source + LIVE probabilities"| S
    O -->|"R14 · chains, BBOs + outcomes"| S
    P -->|"R15 · exact-leg fair value + uncertainty"| S
    B -.->|"R16 · phase +5 → +6 only · no artifact"| O

    B -->|"samples + predictions"| T
    H ==>|"canonical historical OPRA evidence"| T
    T -->|"verified daily / weekly profit models"| S

    P -.->|"owned launch"| W
    W ==>|"optional prior residual model"| P
  end

  subgraph DATASTORE["C:/DATASTORE · VERIFIED FILE BUS — WHAT EACH OWNER READS AND WRITES"]
    direction TB
    STORE_NOTE["Loops do not call one another in memory. A solid edge above means the consumer verifies the producer's persisted artifact;<br/>dotted edges are control/readiness/timing; thick edges are optional, historical, fallback, or asynchronous."]:::note

    subgraph DATA_FOUNDATIONS["FOUNDATIONAL DATA"]
      direction LR
      CME_D["1 · CME/L2 DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · retained pools/cme cursors/events; optional verified CME archive seed<br/><b>WRITES</b> · pools/cme/events · pools/cme/runtime · pools/cme/snapshots<br/>pools/cme/features/cross-asset-context/databento/1h.parquet"]:::dataOwner
      A_D["2 · LOOP A DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · retained stocks/{symbol} provider/calculated state and cycle records<br/><b>WRITES</b> · stocks/{symbol}/bars|quotes|fundamentals|technicals|signals<br/>loop-a/bar-readiness + bar-readiness-latest<br/>.ducketz-loop-a-cycle.json + .ducketz-loop-a-complete.json"]:::dataOwner
      F_D["3 · ALFRED DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · canonical macro vintages + current ml/latest samples decision grid<br/><b>WRITES</b> · pools/macro/features/alfred-release-context/fred<br/>ml/macro-readiness(-latest) · ml/fred-alfred-runtime(-latest)"]:::dataOwner
    end

    subgraph DATA_QUARTER["QUARTER-HOUR DATA"]
      direction LR
      P_D["4 · ACTIVE PRICING DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · Loop A readiness/bars · ALFRED FEDFUNDS · earlier option snapshots<br/>optional ml/option-pricing-loop-native-* model/materialization<br/><b>WRITES</b> · ml/option-pricing-target-outcomes + target-latest<br/>ml/option-pricing-runs + option-pricing-latest · predictions/evaluations/surfaces"]:::dataPrediction
      B_D["5 · LOOP B DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · Loop A stock evidence · CME context · ALFRED readiness/context<br/>option snapshots/features · optional Pricing surfaces<br/><b>WRITES</b> · immutable ml/runs/{run}/samples|predictions|evaluations|monitoring<br/>authoritative ml/latest/run.json"]:::dataPrediction
      O_D["6 · OPTIONS DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · Loop A readiness/latest-complete · Pricing target barrier<br/>pending state + verified history cursors<br/><b>WRITES</b> · stocks/{symbol}/options/snapshots/{provider}<br/>stocks/{symbol}/options/latest/{provider}.json · options/pending-captures"]:::dataOwner
    end

    subgraph DATA_STRATEGY["STRATEGY DATA"]
      direction LR
      S_D["7 · STRATEGY DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · ml/latest · option snapshot heads · ml/option-pricing-latest<br/>Loop A stock BBO · ml/strategy-profit-training-latest<br/><b>WRITES</b> · ml/strategy-runs/{run}/strategy-candidates + strategy-audit<br/>authoritative ml/strategy-latest/run.json"]:::dataPrediction
      T_D["8 · STRATEGY-PROFIT TRAINING DATA<br/><b>READS</b> · Loop B samples/predictions · Loop A 1 h stock bars<br/>market-data/databento/opra/OPRA.PILLAR/{ohlcv-1h,cbbo-1m}<br/><b>WRITES</b> · ml/strategy-profit-modeled-outcomes · ml/strategy-models<br/>ml/strategy-profit-training-runs + strategy-profit-training-latest"]:::dataTrainer
    end

    subgraph DATA_CONSUMERS["READ-ONLY CONSUMERS"]
      direction LR
      UI["Rolling Forecast UI ← ml/latest<br/>Options Strategy UI ← ml/strategy-latest<br/>monitor validates backend value/label parity; visual inspection occurs only when the app is already open"]:::consumer
    end

    CME_D ~~~ A_D ~~~ F_D
    P_D ~~~ B_D ~~~ O_D
    S_D ~~~ T_D
    B_D -->|"directional authority"| UI
    S_D -->|"strategy authority"| UI
  end

  subgraph OPERATIONS["OPERATIONS PLANE — OBSERVES THE SYSTEM; IT IS NOT A NINTH PRODUCTION LOOP"]
    direction LR
    HB["loops-hourly-operations<br/>Loops Monitor + Adaptive Trainer<br/>one wake every local hour at :42"]:::operations
    BASE["EVERY WAKE<br/>run compact scheduled guardian once<br/>verify all 8 process pairs, locks, logs, pointers, receipts, lineage, UI parity, storage<br/>at most one allowlisted liveness repair; zero orders"]:::opsDetail
    NIGHT["ELIGIBLE XNYS SESSION<br/>one bounded 45-minute overnight stage per wake · 13:42–05:42 PT<br/>17 stable stages; 14:42 selects daily/weekly monitor; only 02:42 may build one shadow experiment<br/>05:42 pre-open freeze · no production model/pointer/order mutation"]:::opsDetail
    OPS_D["OPERATIONS EVIDENCE<br/><b>READS</b> · root runtime locks · logs/ducketz · current authorities + receipts<br/><b>WRITES ONLY WHEN WARRANTED</b> · logs/ducketz/system-guardian/audit<br/>stage checkpoints / bounded shadow evidence; unchanged or immature evidence is an explicit skip"]:::opsData

    HB --> BASE
    HB --> NIGHT
    BASE -.->|"observe / guarded repair audit"| OPS_D
    NIGHT ==>|"one receipt-backed stage"| OPS_D
  end

  SYSTEM ~~~ RUNTIMES
  S ~~~ STORE_NOTE
  STORE_NOTE ~~~ HB

